# BiguaSim BlueBoat (Rover) SITL overrides — ArduPilot NAME VALUE format (2-column)
#
# Deliberately starts empty/minimal, unlike t2_biguasim.parm (DjiMatrice) which
# accumulated its tuning over many live SITL runs. Same iterative approach here:
# add parameters only once a live test run shows a concrete need for them (e.g.
# a motor-thrust mapping mismatch, an EKF/GPS glitch specific to the water
# surface, a loop-rate issue) — not preemptively guessed.
